  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "建築師實務與管理",
    "sub_ename": "PRATICE AND MANAGEMENT FOR ARCHITECTS",
    "describe_ch": "本課程是為擔任建築師執行業務時，事先預備建築實務訓練之講習。內容將協助同學：\n1.對於開業建築師職業業務，建立必要基本知識基礎。\n2.應用實務案例的介紹，呈現案例的推動與許可過程。\n3.配合現行市政政策，以培養及結合公務審議能力。\n4.建立及提升建築執業環境的國際性觀念。\n\n1.\t為將來的開業建築師之職業生涯建立必要的知識基礎；\n2.\t藉著一些真實的案例說明並逐步呈現如何完成一個實際案例的運作過程；\n3.\t培養同學的職業道德與責任感；\n4.\t以國際性的觀點去了解建築職業及其執業環境\n",
    "describe_eh": "This course is for the preparation of how to practice as a professional architect. It will help students to understand：\n1.To build up a necessary foundation of knowledge for the professional career as a practicing architect.\n2.Introduction of real project and showing the promotion and licensing process of cases.\n3.Combine with the current municipal policy to practice the integration ability of reviewing regulations. \n4.Establish and improve the international view of the architectural practice environment.\n",
